WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.575 --> 00:00:21.203
Relationship Manager is a progressive web app. In Chrome, Edge or Safari you can install it from the account menu or the browser address bar.

2
00:00:21.203 --> 00:00:26.723
Installed, it runs in its own window with its own icon, on desktop and on phones.

3
00:00:26.723 --> 00:00:39.540
The app shell and everything you have already viewed are cached, so you can browse your network without a connection. Changes wait until you are back online.

4
00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:51.562
Pick an accent colour and the whole palette is derived from it, the way Material You does on Android.

5
00:00:51.562 --> 00:00:56.377
Dark mode is one tap away.

6
00:00:56.377 --> 00:01:02.244
Everything you import stays in your own database. Export the whole workspace as JSON whenever you like.

7
00:01:02.244 --> 00:01:08.455
That is the end of the series. The written guides in Learn cover every topic in more depth.
